@crew keane-davi
// SW5, the endgame pool (plans/ending-spec.html section 9): said only after you choose to stay. Every line is
// gated by the bare condition "endgame" (EN2 adds it to the line filter, section 22); "endgame:early" marks the
// lines that only make sense in the first two weeks after you stay (RV21).

== chat
? endgame:early
- Hey, hey. You stayed! I mopped the engine room in your honour. You could eat off it.   #funny
? endgame
- Ordinary night. Cleaned panel four. Then panel four again. It's a good panel.   #funny
- My gran on Kesh sent a song for you. Same one as Eklund's gran. We're looking into it.   #funny
? endgame:early
- Night radio played something cheerful at three. I took it as a sign. About you staying.   #warm
? endgame tier>=friend
- Stay as long as you like, mate. The floor'll be clean whenever you come down.   #warm

== bye
? endgame
- Night! Lovely lift, that. Lovely. Off you go.   #funny
